on chance per inherited allele: 6%"],["INPUT",{"__playwright_value_":"6","id":"ei-mutation","type":"range","min":"0","max":"20","step":"1","value":"6"}],["P",{"class":"ei-small"},"Mutation rates are deliberately exaggerated for a short lesson. New changes are random with respect to what the environment rewards."]]],["DETAILS",{"class":"ei-reset"},["SUMMARY",{},"Start a new expedition"],["DIV",{"class":"ei-stack"},["P",{"class":"ei-small"},"Starting over replaces this island and timeline. Export your data or save a finding first. The same seed and the same actions reproduce the same result."],["LABEL",{"for":"ei-seed"},"World seed"],["INPUT",{"__playwright_value_":"2026","type":"text","inputmode":"numeric","id":"ei-seed","maxlength":"10","value":"2026"}],["BUTTON",{"type":"button"},"Restart with this seed"],["BUTTON",{"type":"button"},"Generate a fresh world"]]]]],["DIV",{"id":"ei-panel-evidence","role":"tabpanel","aria-labelledby":"ei-tab-evidence","hidden":"","tabindex":"0","class":"ei-stack"},["SECTION",{"class":"ei-card ei-stack ei-highlights","tabindex":"-1","aria-label":"Expedition highlights","data-highlight-key":"empty"},["DIV",{"class":"ei-row ei-between"},["DIV",{},["DIV",{"class":"ei-kicker"},"Small moments. Bigger questions."],["H2",{},"Expedition highlights"]],["SPAN",{"class":"ei-tag","data-kept-count":"0"},"0/6 · moments kept"]],["P",{"class":"ei-small"},"Find a moment worth investigating, revisit the actual island, and keep it in your collection. These are observations from your expedition, not proof of a general pattern."],["DIV",{"class":"ei-callout"},["STRONG",{},"Your story is just beginning."],["P",{},"Advance a generation to record survival, inheritance and new variation. Highlights appear only when something has actually been recorded."]]],["DIV",{"class":"ei-callout"},["STRONG",{},"Watch the next generation unfold. "],"Advance once to reveal which parents survived and what their offspring inherited. You can replay the same evidence as often as